                      {
                        "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                        "args": {
                          "text": [
                            "The intense heat and\nlethal doses of\nradiation from the \nSun cause Mercury to",
                            "reach over 750 °F\n(400 °C). Since it has\nno atmosphere to hold\nthe heat, the",
                            "temperature can drop\nto a frigid -290 °F\n(-180 °C)."
                          ],
                          "__section": "text",
