                      {
                        "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                        "args": {
                          "text": [
                            "NASA launched a \nrobotic space probe,\nMariner 10, that \nvisited Mercury in",
                            "1973. After taking\n2,800+ photos, it was\nsent to orbit the Sun\nbefore it ran out of",
                            "gas, where it's\npresumably still\norbiting today."
                          ],
